<title>UK: Finland adds 150 million Swiss francs to 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Finland adds 150 million Swiss francs to 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINLAND</p>
<p> AMT   *300 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25 PCT  MATURITY    16.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103	 PAY DATE    16.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 150 MLN SFR ON 05.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    EBS</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  FINLAND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
